   Starik, N (Corresponding Author), Deutsche Fledermauswarte eV, Berlin, Germany.
   Starik, Nicole, Humboldt Univ, Albrecht Daniel Thaer Inst Agr \& Hort Sci, Fac Life Sci, Berlin, Germany.
   Starik, Nicole, Deutsche Fledermauswarte eV, Berlin, Germany.
   Goettert, Thomas, Eberswalde Univ Sustainable Dev, Res Ctr Sustainabil Transformat Transfer, Eberswalde, Germany.},
DOI = {10.3389/fevo.2022.939408},
Article-Number = {939408},
ISSN = {2296-701X},
